<ontology/use_soap_manufacture/use_soap_manufacture__0257__q3/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. SOAP" ;
